<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Welcome to My Weird World</title>

<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        font-family: Georgia, serif;
        background: linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            #2f3e2c,
            #4f6f52,
            #a3b18a,
            #588157
        );
        overflow: hidden;
        color: #f5f5dc;
    }

    .container {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 3rem;
        max-width: 700px;
        background: rgba(20, 20, 20, 0.25);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
        border: 2px solid rgba(245, 245, 220, 0.2);
        border-radius: 25px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }

    h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        color: #e9edc9;
        text-shadow: 2px 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    }

    .subtitle {
        font-style: italic;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        color: #d4e09b;
    }

    .description {
        line-height: 1.7;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        color: #f0ead2;
    }

    .button-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .weird-btn {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
        color: #f5f5dc;
        border: 2px solid #d4e09b;
        padding: 12px 24px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 1rem;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        cursor: pointer;
    }

    .weird-btn:hover {
        background: #d4e09b;
        color: #2f3e2c;
        transform: translateY(-3px) rotate(-2deg);
    }

    .leaf {
        position: absolute;
        font-size: 2rem;
        opacity: 0.2;
        animation: float 8s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    .leaf:nth-child(1) { top: 10%; left: 15%; }
    .leaf:nth-child(2) { top: 70%; left: 10%; }
    .leaf:nth-child(3) { top: 20%; right: 15%; }
    .leaf:nth-child(4) { bottom: 10%; right: 20%; }

    @keyframes float {
        50% {
            transform: translateY(-20px) rotate(10deg);
        }
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="leaf">🍃</div>
<div class="leaf">🌿</div>
<div class="leaf">🍄</div>
<div class="leaf">🌙</div>

<div class="container">
    <h1>Welcome to My Weird World</h1>

    <p class="subtitle">
        A tiny corner of the internet filled with art, music, moss, moonlight and odd little treasures.
    </p>

    <p class="description">
        Hi, I'm a curious soul who loves strange aesthetics, nature, creativity and all things a little unusual.
        Wander through my interests below and explore the pieces that make up my wonderfully weird world.
    </p>

    <div class="button-container">
        <a href="art.html" class="weird-btn">🎨 Art</a>
        <a href="music.html" class="weird-btn">🎶 Music</a>
        <a href="witchy.html" class="weird-btn">🌙 Witchy Stuff</a>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
